42	+### Use it from your phone or tablet (optional)
43	+
44	+Your phone becomes another screen on the Moneo running on this computer: same data, same ChatGPT, bank and Scalable connections. It is off until you turn it on, and nothing changes on this computer.
45	+
46	+1. Go to **Settings → Keys and connections → Phone and tablet** and click **Turn on**. Moneo tells you if it needs [Tailscale](https://tailscale.com/download) installed, a sign-in, or one approval for secure addresses.
47	+2. On your phone or tablet, install Tailscale and sign in with the same account.
48	+3. Scan the code in Settings, then choose **Add to Home Screen**.
49	+
50	+Only devices in your Tailscale account can reach Moneo, and they get in without a password, so don't add other people to it. Leave Tailscale Funnel off: Moneo refuses traffic from the public internet.
51	+
52	+Keep this computer on and awake with Moneo running: on a laptop, stay plugged in and set closing the lid to do nothing. On Windows, `tailscale set --unattended=true` keeps Tailscale connected after a restart. New ChatGPT, bank and Scalable logins start on this computer, because those services only return to its address.
